 "_read": "`covered_by_kv` is the ONLY branch that lets a child skip the vision tower without an encoder-cache hit, and the encoder cache is keyed by request id so a sibling can never provide one. If frac_calls_covered_by_kv is low while the LM prefill is shared, the prefix hit is being computed AFTER this decision, not before it."
